WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,040
After being caught by NPC

2
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:02,160
They will go their own way

3
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:04,280
Act out the process of killing you if you are too scared

4
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:06,040
You can press the rescue button on the cotton hammer

5
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:08,080
The employees will take you away as a renegade NPC.

6
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:11,200
The cotton hammer is the prop you use to attack NPCs when you encounter them.

7
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,440
They will cooperate and fall

8
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,400
Queue now to get your ward number

9
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,600
It turns out that players can still chase NPCs

10
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,600
The pressure that I have been unable to vent recently

11
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:20,200
Now I have found a place

12
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,080
Now queue up to receive your ward number and enter the haunted house

13
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:23,760
Find your room and close the door

14
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:24,760
The door will automatically lock

15
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,880
I've been thinking nonsense for so long. Get out of my way.

16
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:27,880
Let's go in first

17
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:29,240
Why are you cutting in line?

18
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:31,560
Are you in line?

19
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:32,560
what do you know

20
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:34,560
I went in first to save you.

21
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:36,560
It’s really a dog biting Lu Dongbing

22
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:37,560
Who are you calling a dog?

23
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:40,460
You can't reason with this kind of person

24
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:41,460
After starting

25
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,460
We get them eliminated

26
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:50,320
Is it because I failed to win the votes of these ten people?

27
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:51,320
Kill through the haunted house

28
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:54,320
Can you threaten the NPC to help decrypt it?

29
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:55,320
This should be faster

30
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:57,800
It can't be considered cheating, right?
